<DemoExample Title="Keyboard" RazorCode="@example15RazorCode" Id="example15" PreventRenderForMcpClient>
    <div>
        The arrow keys, <b>Home</b> and <b>End</b> move the focus (flipped in RTL, skipping disabled options). By default
        every option is a tab stop; <b>SingleTabStop</b> makes the bar one stop like a toolbar. <b>WrapNavigation</b>
        wraps at the ends, and <b>SelectOnFocus</b> moves the selection with the focus (Manual mode).
