<DemoExample Title="Style & Class" RazorCode="@example21RazorCode" Id="example21">
    <div>
        <b>Style</b>/<b>Class</b> for the root, <b>Styles</b>/<b>Classes</b> for its parts, an option's own
        <b>Style</b>/<b>Class</b>, and the public <b>--bit-NavBar-*</b> CSS variables, which re-skin every navbar when
        set on <code>:root</code> or a class.
    </div>
    <br />
    <div>Component's Style:</div><br />
